WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.280
I had learned to keep on moving
With my eyes upon the shore

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:42.960
Holding tightly to the things
That I trusted in before

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.980
Then You met me where I stood
The work still in my hands

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:56.180
Jesus, You said, “Follow Me”
Before I knew the road You planned

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:07.020
You know my name
You know my heart

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:11.520
You have found me
Where I am

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:16.700
I turn toward You
Take one step

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.520
Leave the shore;
follow Your plan

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.660
You are calling
Calling

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.000
Jesus, You are calling me

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.000
You are calling
Calling

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:40.440
And I'll follow where You lead

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.180
You know my name
I hear Your voice

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:50.340
You have taken hold of me

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.500
You are calling
Calling

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:59.500
Jesus, let it be.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:19.840
Not because I earned Your favor
Not because my hands were clean

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.680
By Your Grace, by Your mercy
They do not stand between.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:29.140
There are things I cannot carry
There are nets I have to leave

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:35.720
But the One who stands before me
Is the One who first loved me

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:40.860
You know my name
You know my heart

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:45.300
You have found me
Where I am

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:50.480
I turn toward You
Take one step

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:55.320
Leave the shore;
follow Your plan

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.320
You are calling
Calling

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:04.860
Jesus, You are calling me

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.500
You are calling
Calling

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:14.180
And I'll follow where You lead

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:16.940
You know my name
I hear Your voice

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:24.060
You have taken hold of me

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:27.040
You are calling
Calling

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:33.040
Jesus, let it be.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:52.640
I do not know
Each turn ahead

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:57.440
But I know You
And what You said

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:02.260
You give me life
You call me Yours

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:08.700
I hear Your voice
And leave the shore

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:16.960
Jesus
I will follow You

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:26.540
You are calling
I am listening

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:36.120
You are calling
I am turning

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:44.320
You are calling

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:49.380
I will follow
Jesus

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:57.020
I will follow You
You are calling

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:04.900
Calling
Jesus, You are calling me

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.340
You are calling
Calling

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:15.120
And I'll follow where You lead
You know my name

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:24.160
I hear Your voice
You have taken hold of me

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.260
You are calling
Calling

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:32.800
Jesus, let it be.

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:38.860
You call my name
I turn toward You

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:46.940
You give me life

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:52.900
I belong to You

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.860
You are calling
Calling

00:05:55.860 --> 00:06:05.840
Jesus, I will follow You
You are calling

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:13.250
And I will follow You
